          <p style={`${S.intro}max-width:96ch;`}>Breathe is a residential, LGBTQIA+-affirming healing center treating addiction and mental health as equal, connected parts of the same journey. Affirming care here means clinicians who understand minority stress, staff who use your pronouns without being asked twice, and a community where your energy goes into recovery instead of into managing how you're seen.</p>
